<title>USA: Interlake to record gain on sale in Q4.</title>
<headline>Interlake to record gain on sale in Q4.</headline>
<dateline>LISLE, Ill. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interlake Corp, which earlier this month reported the sale of its packaging businesses to Samuel Manu-Tech Inc of Ontario, Canada, said it will record a gain of about $40 million in the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>The company said it anticipates using proceeds from the sale to reduce long-term debt and to invest in its other businesses.</p>
<p>Interlake is a diversified manufacturing company with business in engineered materials and aerospace components.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
